# GolfSol premium mockup theme (design pack)

Canonical artefacts vendored from `golfsol-cursor-design-pack`:

- [design/golfsol-premium-design.json](mdc:design/golfsol-premium-design.json) — colours, gradients, typography, radii, shadows, layout, component notes, implementation checklist.
- [design/golfsol-premium-cursor-prompt.md](mdc:design/golfsol-premium-cursor-prompt.md) — full implementation narrative, suggested global utility names (`.gs-page`, `.gs-card`, …), page-by-page guidance.
- [design/golfsol-premium-cursor-rules.txt](mdc:design/golfsol-premium-cursor-rules.txt) — original short rules from the pack’s `.cursorrules` (same intent as below).

## Non-negotiables

- Do **not** rebuild from scratch or remove routes, Supabase, auth, forms, admin/client logic, or PDF/email pipelines unless explicitly requested.
- Theme work is **presentation-only** unless paired with an approved behaviour change.

## Visual direction

- Cream page backgrounds, deep forest green surfaces, gold/yellow CTAs, crest identity, rounded luxury cards, soft shadows, cinematic golf and Mercedes imagery.
- Mobile-first: large hero type, generous tap targets, no cramped layouts.

## Implementation

- Prefer extending existing primitives (`ge-page`, `GeNavbar`, `GeHero`, `GeButton`, `lux-card`, `lux-field`, `tailwind.config.js`) over parallel one-off hex values.
- When updating colours or gradients, align with `golfsol-premium-design.json` `colors` and `gradients` (resolve small drift vs older mockup JSON by treating this file as the in-repo premium reference).

## Cohesion with other rules

- Product and data model: [quote-first-client-admin-dashboards.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/quote-first-client-admin-dashboards.mdc).
- Dashboard UI refactors: [dashboard-portal-ui-modernization.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/dashboard-portal-ui-modernization.mdc) — do not contradict phone-first / three-service story; update **visual** prose there over time if it drifts from this pack.

## Verification

After substantive UI edits: `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run build`.
